{
  "project": {
    "name": "Sew-On Snap",
    "slug": "sew-on-snap",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A 3D-printed sew-on snap fastener — the stud-and-socket disc pair a sewer stitches through rim holes onto baby-bodysuit crotch plackets, varsity plackets, and lightweight closures. This is the rigid hard good the Fashion Cabinet `sew-on-snap` notion places and bridges to here for its geometry, sized so a garment's finished placket dimension drives the finding.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un broche de presión de coser impreso en 3D — el par de discos macho y hembra que se cose por los ojales del borde en las entrepiernas de pañaleros, en las carteras de chamarras universitarias y en cierres ligeros. Es el herraje rígido que el avío `sew-on-snap` de Fashion Cabinet coloca y al que se puentea aquí, dimensionado para que la medida terminada de la cartera determine el avío.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/sew-on-snap.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "sew-on-snap",
      "snap",
      "press-stud",
